    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: First Visit")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> and he blushes slightly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span>? He’s alright, I guess. Never had a problem with him. Though I’ve also never really talked to him before so…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> shrugs.
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span>, frowning slightly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s fine, though we’ve never really talked much. I think he likes a show my mom was in, so he’s always been really nervous around me.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> shrugs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m sure he’s nice enough, though he lets people walk all over him.”</span>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

