    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I- I don’t know him that well. He just started like you so, I- I haven’t gotten the chance to talk to him yet. I would like to though. He seems nice.”</span>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I- I haven’t really spoken to him yet… much…”</span> He rubs the back of his head nervously and you ask if somethings wrong. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No, not at all! It’s just…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> sighs, relenting, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I caught him washing his hands in the bathroom the other day. It was just us, so I thought maybe I could talk to him. Make a good first impression. Then I slipped on some water and fell face-first into a mop bucket.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> blushes brightly just at remembering the experience. You can’t help but chuckle. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He was nice about it, but I wanted to just die so… I ran off. Probably thinks I’m a weirdo now. Haha…”</span> He laughs nervously.
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>